WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,110
I don’t understand, Smida

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:04,110
The cake should be given to my brother first.

3
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:06,110
Brother eat it really

4
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:09,240
I'm the first one, okay okay

5
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,240
Since you begged me sincerely

6
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:14,420
Then I'll try it hard

7
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,460
not very sweet

8
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:22,100
Brother, don’t you like it? No way?

9
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,100
It’s time for you to take your medicine again

10
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,100
I asked you to give medicine to the cat

11
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,100
Have you fed it? Wait a minute.

12
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,100
Accompany the ink medicine

13
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,100
How old are you?

14
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,100
Still fighting for food with a three-and-a-half-year-old child

15
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:34,530
I don't have this

16
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:35,530
Brother, listen to my excuses

17
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:36,530
Abo, listen to my explanation

18
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:37,530
It’s not me who steals Yoyo’s food

19
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:38,530
He was too full

20
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:39,530
I'm afraid he'll hold on

21
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:40,530
Right, Yoyo

22
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:47,970
Just your round belly

23
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:49,970
Why do you have the nerve to say the word hungry?

24
00:00:49,970 --> 00:00:53,700
Brother, this cake was really given to me by him

25
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:55,700
But he's too clingy

26
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:57,820
Don't, then don't

27
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,820
Yoyo come here

28
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:02,980
Don't tell me, it's quite charitable.

29
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:05,230
I'll have to exercise more from now on.

30
00:01:05,230 --> 00:01:07,230
Otherwise, a man who can’t even hold his sister

31
00:01:07,230 --> 00:01:09,230
What a good brother

32
00:01:09,230 --> 00:01:14,050
I'm hungry. What do I want to eat?

33
00:01:14,050 --> 00:01:15,050
I'll do it for you

34
00:01:15,050 --> 00:01:23,160
Brother, please touch his belly

35
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:25,160
If you eat any more, it will explode.
